{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"d8f191c144db0e6b3877704cc3872404c7a5ae2586a8d63a303efebdc1de6ab1","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"7f59e596fded9793a4a11f0139b684590f8b1490db047b4503e0dac36edd0460","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"80602bf122e81447eefe34fcbe417fe7e43a1e2d84cf18697723f9030afdbb2b","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"81b9f14fe832437920c0ddbf3eb3ae675b390e0c5473da67d6788612e7f7493a","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"81cf60103e43abd42593763972335be52c6d31760d8a1d1539e337602f209e86","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-cults/data/lore/fay-willows.lua:278 原文 \"I could hear the voice who had stirred the people around me to these brutal acts let loose a wretched cry that echoed through my head\"：发出凄厉叫喊并在脑中回荡的是那个煽动者的声音本身；译文「我能听到一个声音，这个声音激起了我周围的人对这些残忍的行为放声呐喊，在我的脑海中回荡」把 let loose a wretched cry 改成了人群呐喊，施事错位。另 :282 \"the simmering fire\"（余火未熄）译「熊熊燃烧的大火」语义相反；:280 \"more sickened\" 译「更让我感到恐惧」偏离。"},{"revision_key":"82726713980974bfa3f550ee5404885caa51e50cc7c34b58a89b0b569a7f36cc","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"829f4ab17efde2b79f3c0dbdb0467975a2fbda9458edf8de06932696eb5c21c1","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-cults/data/talents/demented/nether.lua:155 \"Targets cannot be struck by more than a single rift explosion at once.\" 意为同一目标同时只会受到一次裂缝爆炸伤害（多道裂缝重叠时不叠加）；译文「一次湮灭不能多次伤害同一目标」变成单次爆炸不会重复命中同一目标，限制对象弄错，机制表述错误。另 :154 \"the rift detonates\" 译「湮灭」而非爆炸，与后句 rift explosion 的对应也不清楚。"},{"revision_key":"837d40e6910d13b0f7b4aa7d5304b568440e07a82483d06767300efb83b02bac","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"84a82d1ccbf18acbfc7da71d5da85b7f2111b7b3055828e02d137e23d30f456c","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-cults/data/lore/fay-willows.lua:148 \"The rather straightforward response seemingly got me a quick smirk.\" 是将军对我的回答报以一笑；译文「让我很快笑了起来」把笑的人弄成了叙述者，施事错误。:152 \"Devastation of all kinds swept across the continent, some perhaps not even of our world.\" 指有些灾害或许并非来自本世界；译文「甚至包括我们的世界之外的地方」把它误解成波及的范围到了世界之外。:154 \"they had acted to stop what he believed...\" 译「他们的行动阻止了」，把「为了阻止」说成了「已经阻止」。"},{"revision_key":"875405bb8f859fad77dbc2754e1c67ed9255b6cca885061a8517d24866d51e07","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"89eaa9d522560726d456e947fe941e9b55ab3b3ef6228e919ae8dd7e7eaa82d2","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"8a4b1870ba7d172b5df38a374dfe7ff40af5b282cb9277350c21a31ab55ae3ad","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"tome-cults/data/lore/kroshkkur.lua:28 \"seekers of forbidden knowledge\" 只是追寻禁忌知识的人；译文「寻求着禁忌知识的先知」凭空添加了「先知」身份。:30 \"discovered magic\" 译「禁忌魔法」，添加了原文没有的限定。:32 \"scattered, mindless beings for them to sweep aside\" 译「被他们当做害虫一样轻轻扫开的，毫无心智的乌合之众」，漏掉 scattered 且添加了害虫比喻。"}]}